###

### Test 4: Get Profile - No Token (Should Return 401 Unauthorized)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/users/me
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Test 5: Get Profile - Invalid Token (Should Return 401 Unauthorized)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer invalid_token_xyz
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Test 6: Get Profile - Expired Token (Should Return 401 Unauthorized)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzM4NCJ9.eyJ0b2tlblR5cGUiOiJhY2Nlc3MiLCJ1c2VySWQiOiJhNGRhMGFlYi04NzU2LTQzYTItODAyYi0wZWFhYTRlZmQxMjkiLCJzdWIiOiJqb2huLmRvZUBleGFtcGxlLmNvbSIsImlhdCI6MTcwODEwODgwMCwiZXhwIjoxNzA4MTA5NzAwfQ.expired_signature
Content-Type: application/json

###

